{
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "description": "图形化 JWT 漏洞利用工具，覆盖常见 JWT 漏洞验证向量",
    "homepage": "https://github.com/zjeweler/PyJWTInspector",
    "license": "unknown",
    "url": "https://github.com/zjeweler/PyJWTInspector/archive/refs/tags/v1.0.0.zip#/PyJWTInspector-source.zip",
    "hash": "sha256:CF52C9F243E0F7E2F697F07477400C8B13D7A34CA20D3A99D726324A2AFEFE53",
    "extract_dir": "PyJWTInspector-1.0.0",
    "suggest": {
        "python": "uv"
    },
    "pre_install": [
        "Set-Content \"$dir\\PyJWTInspector.bat\" '@pushd %~dp0', '@uv run python \"PyJWTInspector.pyw\" %*', '@popd' -Encoding Ascii"
    ],
    "post_install": [
        "uv venv \"$dir\\.venv\"",
        "uv pip install -r \"$dir\\requirements.txt\" --python \"$dir\\.venv\\Scripts\\python.exe\""
    ],
    "bin": "PyJWTInspector.bat",
    "shortcuts": [
        [
            "PyJWTInspector.bat",
            "PyJWTInspector",
            "",
            "favicon.ico"
        ]
    ],
    "checkver": "github",
    "autoupdate": {
        "url": "https://github.com/zjeweler/PyJWTInspector/archive/refs/tags/v$version.zip#/PyJWTInspector-source.zip",
        "extract_dir": "PyJWTInspector-$version"
    },
    "notes": [
        "【工具类型】: 安全测试 / JWT 漏洞利用",
        "【主要功能】: 图形化 JWT 漏洞利用工具，支持解码/编码/签名校验/漏洞一键生成/字典爆破/Payload 导出",
        "【适用场景】: Web 安全测试、JWT 漏洞验证、CTF 比赛",
        "【技术特点】: 基于 Python + PyQt6 开发，通过 uv 管理虚拟环境以源码方式运行",
        "【注意事项】: 仅支持 Windows；首次运行前需安装 uv，post_install 会自动创建 .venv 并安装依赖；源码目录内 password 文件夹提供默认字典"
    ]
}
